        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DLG150SMTSSBR, Delong Brass Door Pull with Hourglass Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1-1/2 Inch Brass Delong Pull is a beautifully made door handle that allows for a fully customizable look. It is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths in a wide range of finishes. The finish of the brackets and the pull handle are selected separately, so you can mix and match finishes for a look that is all your own. The Delong Brass Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Delong 150 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLG04-specifications.pdf?v=1704262327\"><b>First Impressions DLG150SMTSSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>DLG150012SMTSSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Bracket Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DLG150024SMTSSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Bracket Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DLG150036SMTSSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Bracket Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1-1/2 Delong Brass Pull",
                "description": "The 1-1/2 Inch Brass Delong Pull is a beautifully made door handle that allows for a fully customizable look. It is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths in a wide range of finishes. The finish of the brackets and the pull handle are selected separately, so you can mix and match finishes for a look that is all your own. The Delong Brass Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, glass, fiberglass, or metal doors.",
                "keywords": "1-1/2 Inch Diameter Brass Delong Pulls, Delong Brass Pulls, 1-1/2 Inch Brass Delong Pulls, First Impressions DLG04, FII-DLG04 brass door handles, First Impressions DLG04012 12 inch Delong pulls, First Impressions DLG04024 24 inch Delong pulls, First Impressions DLG04036 36 inch Delong pulls, Delong Brass Door Pull with Hourglass Mounts, First Impressions Delong Series 4 Door Pulls, FII-DLG150SMTSSBR, First Impressions DLG150SMTSSBR,"
